=== FOLDER STRUCTURE ===
app/Controllers/ → AuthController, DashboardController, KatalogController,
OrderController, RevisiController, PaymentController,
PengirimanController, TrackingController, LaporanController, ProfilController
app/Models/ → UserModel, PelangganModel, KatalogModel, OrderModel,
PaymentModel, RevisiDesainModel, PengirimanModel, NotificationModel
app/Filters/ → AuthFilter.php, RoleFilter.php
app/Helpers/ → notification_helper.php
app/Views/layouts/ → main.php (sidebar+topbar), auth.php
app/Views/[module]/ → per controller
FILE UPLOAD PATH (WAJIB untuk semua controller dengan upload):

- Simpan file: FCPATH . 'uploads/[folder]/' → fisik di public/uploads/[folder]/
- Tampilkan URL: base_url('uploads/[folder]/' . $filename)
- JANGAN pakai WRITEPATH . 'uploads/...' — writable/ tidak bisa diakses via browser.
- Setiap folder upload wajib punya index.html (403) untuk cegah directory listing.

Mapping path per modul (OrderController, PaymentController, RevisiController, ProfilController, dll.):
KatalogController → FCPATH . 'uploads/katalog/' (gambar produk)
OrderController → FCPATH . 'uploads/referensi/' (file referensi desain pelanggan)
PaymentController → FCPATH . 'uploads/bukti_bayar/' (bukti transfer DP & pelunasan)
RevisiController → FCPATH . 'uploads/draft_desain/' (draft desain produksi, max 1MB)
OrderController (EAV) → FCPATH . 'uploads/lampiran_peta/' (lampiran peta / field upload form)
ProfilController → FCPATH . 'uploads/dokumen_verifikasi/' (arsip dokumen kerja sama perusahaan, diunggah Admin)

Contoh simpan (ikuti KatalogController::processGambarUpload):
$uploadDir = FCPATH . 'uploads/bukti_bayar/';
  if (! is_dir($uploadDir)) { mkdir($uploadDir, 0755, true); }
  $file->move($uploadDir, time() . '\_' . $file->getClientName());

